egory_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"AStCov7pI9nBwpIJhhjihQ","review_id":"w0ZFTfvfJJ0X3IPxZMykPA","date":"2013-06-21T15:23:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9348071217536926,"text_excerpt":"Great bartenders and jukebox. Love to just hang out and play on the pool table. Very good vibe and so close to Bourbon street, yet far enough away from it to enjoy. It's a time warp in there, every time you go, all of a sudden it's 4am and you have no idea how. One of my favorites in the quarter!"},{"business_id":"AStCov7pI9nBwpIJhhjihQ","review_id":"BPJrP-xz6b51AWsxFRYvVA","date":"2018-12-28T16:08:33","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9297803640365601,"text_excerpt":"Great time wish we had more time to spend here. We stopped in for our last drink of the night. I ordered a car bomb and he ordered a grasshopper. Bartender was cool and accommodating and made great drinks. The have a pool table It's a great little Irish pub!"},{"business_id":"AStCov7pI9nBwpIJhhjihQ","review_id":"Gl2VxXYzKJjhFqEhjb0Cmg","date":"2016-08-29T00:21:10","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9212020635604858,"text_excerpt":"I really loved this bar. On a night where we were trying to avoid a huge crowd, it was a life saver. They have a jukebox in the back and it's nice and dark. I love a dark bar! A few street performers filtered in and out for drinks and it just seems like a really fun spot. The bartender was really friendly and welcoming and the beer was good."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"AStCov7pI9nBwpIJhhjihQ","photo_id":"s8QEM_hAhXIcuP2GCZB3CQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/s8QEM_hAhXIcuP2GCZB3CQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.93059045